            "title": "Berkshire Hathaway fully exits stake in Chinese EV maker BYD",
            "description": "<p>BYD (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/BYD\">BYD</a>, <a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/1211.HK\">1211.HK</a>) stock drifted lower in Monday's session after CNBC reported Berkshire Hathaway (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/BRK-B\">BRK-B</a>, <a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/BRK-A\">BRK-A</a>) CEO Warren Buffett <a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/news/byd-stock-drops-as-warren-buffetts-berkshire-hathaway-fully-exits-stake-165613035.html\">sold off the firm's full stake </a>in the Chinese EV maker.</p>\n<p>Yahoo Finance senior autos reporter <a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://www.yahoo.com/author/pras-subramanian/\">Pras Subramanian</a> breaks down the latest.</p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more\u00a0<a data-i13n=\"cpos:7;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-domination-overtime/\">Market Domination Overtime</a>.</p>",
