            "description": "<p>Market Catalysts host <a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://www.yahoo.com/author/julie-hyman/?.tsrc=fin-srch\">Julie Hyman</a> tracks several of the day's top trending stock tickers, including Oracle (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/ORCL\">ORCL</a>) as it is <a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/news/oracle-announces-ceo-shakeup-company-named-in-tiktok-deal-142215001.html\">named in the framework of a TikTok deal</a>, Compass, Inc.'s (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/COMP\">COMP</a>) bid to buy Anywhere Real Estate (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/HOUS\">HOUS</a>) for $1.5 billion, and Berkshire Hathaway (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/BRK-B\">BRK-B</a>, <a data-i13n=\"cpos:7;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/BRK-A\">BRK-A</a>) CEO Warren Buffett announcing that he has sold his entire stake in BYD (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:8;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/1211.HK\">1211.HK</a>, <a data-i13n=\"cpos:9;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/BYDDY\">BYDDY</a>).</p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more\u00a0<a data-i13n=\"cpos:10;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-catalysts/\">Market Catalysts</a>.</p>",
